### =====================================================
### Login 2FA Resend Email - POST /account/login/2fa/resend-email
### NOTA: {{token}} debe ser el mfaToken devuelto por
### /account/login cuando requiresTwoFactor = true
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Reenviar código 2FA por email (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/resend-email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test 2: Sin token (mfaToken) — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/resend-email
